flowchart TD
  accTitle: Observe isolated recovery flow
  accDescr {
    Backups are exported, encrypted, downloaded, and restored in a disposable isolated
    environment. Verification then decides whether recovery evidence is published; otherwise
    the failure is reported and rollback revokes export access while preserving evidence.
  }
  A[Start: Observe recovery review] --> B[Export fixed app/config/data or Fantasy backup]
  B --> C[Pinned SSH to local server]
  C --> D[Encrypt and copy to cloud destination]
  D --> E[Download backup for restore]
  E --> F[Restore in disposable isolated environment]
  F --> G[Apply verification and check deployed revision]
  G --> H{Acceptance met?}
  H -->|Yes| I[Publish recovery evidence]
  H -->|No| J[Report failure honestly and preserve evidence]
  J --> K[Rollback if needed]
  K --> L[Reload systemd and Caddy, revoke export access]
